+index 8975ecb..eb36fa3 100644
+--- a/DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md
++++ b/DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md
+@@ -25,9 +25,9 @@ OpenSearch components build using Java 21 at a minimum. This means you must have
+ To build from the command line, use `./gradlew`.
